From 44450ec4652f2bc1160f9bd008cabe07baf66dca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 17:19:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-301: protected-win vulkan-cm1-f16b-staging-mul-mat-id +
 row-26 workload 780M -> Radeon 890M (X1)

Registers 50b195beba (MUL_MAT_ID f16-B staging, default on) in
tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json with its served A/B, op gate and KL
receipts. Also corrects the vulkan-fa-sparse-prefill-qsa workload: every
lane-301 cell ran on the Minisforum AI X1 Pro-470 Radeon 890M, not a 780M.

Origin: lane-301
Measured-effect: none (registration only, no code change; the registered effect of 50b195beba is prefill +2.3/+2.1/+1.6/+1.5% at 2K/8K/16K/32K (cache/qsa-x1-lane/cells/c14-10061050-state.json))
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json | 26 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 25 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json b/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
index 35e6030069..36b76621d2 100644
--- a/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
+++ b/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
@@ -1775,7 +1775,7 @@
       ],
