-      "workload": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next GSQ-RCO IQ3_S (ISTA-DASLab), llama-server -ub 4096 -b 4096 -c 33792 -fa on -lm dio, F16 KV, 780M Vulkan; prompts 2K/8K/16K/32K tokens, n_predict 128, interleaved A/B/C x2 rounds logger off (c3-10051215, 32K arms in their own timed batch).",
+      "workload": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next GSQ-RCO IQ3_S (ISTA-DASLab), llama-server -ub 4096 -b 4096 -c 33792 -fa on -lm dio, F16 KV, Radeon 890M Vulkan (Minisforum AI X1 Pro-470); prompts 2K/8K/16K/32K tokens, n_predict 128, interleaved A/B/C x2 rounds logger off (c3-10051215, 32K arms in their own timed batch).",
