+      "measured_effect": "Prefill tok/s off -> on, mean of 2 rounds: 2K 214.4 -> 219.4 (+2.3%), 8K 213.9 -> 218.4 (+2.1%), 16K 204.6 -> 207.9 (+1.6%), 32K 193.8 -> 196.7 (+1.5%). Decode flat (2K 10.58 -> 10.62, 32K 10.39 -> 10.42).",
